#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
msgid "Yii uses [PSR-7 `Response`](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-7/) in the web application to represent response."
msgstr "O Yii usa o [`Response` da PSR-7](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-7/) na aplicação web para representar a resposta."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
msgid "The object should be constructed and returned as a result of the execution of controller actions or other middleware.  Usually, the middleware has a response factory injected into its constructor."
msgstr "O objeto deve ser criado e retornado como resultado da execução das actions de controllers ou de outros middlewares.  Normalmente, o middleware recebe uma response factory injetada no construtor."

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseFactoryInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class PostAction\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private ResponseFactoryInterface $responseFactory\n"
"    )\n"
"    {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function view(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $response = $this->responseFactory->createResponse();\n"
"        $response->getBody()->write('Hello!');\n"
"        return $response;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseFactoryInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class PostAction\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private ResponseFactoryInterface $responseFactory\n"
"    )\n"
"    {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function view(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $response = $this->responseFactory->createResponse();\n"
"        $response->getBody()->write('Hello!');\n"
"        return $response;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Status code"
msgstr "Código de status"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
msgid "You can set a status code like the following:"
msgstr "Você pode definir o código de status assim:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Status;\n"
"\n"
"$response = $response->withStatus(Status::NOT_FOUND);\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Status;\n"
"\n"
"$response = $response->withStatus(Status::NOT_FOUND);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
msgid "Majority of status codes are available from `Status` class for convenience and readability."
msgstr "A maioria dos códigos de status está disponível na classe `Status`, por conveniência e legibilidade."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
msgid "Router may return a response before an action runs.  For example, an `OPTIONS` request to a known route path gets an automatic `204 No Content` response with an `Allow` header that lists supported methods.  See [Automatic OPTIONS responses](routing.md#automatic-options-responses) for routing details."
msgstr "O router pode retornar uma resposta antes de a action rodar.  Por exemplo, uma requisição `OPTIONS` para o caminho de uma rota conhecida recebe automaticamente uma resposta `204 No Content` com um header `Allow` listando os métodos suportados.  Veja [Respostas OPTIONS automáticas](routing.md#respostas-options-automaticas) para os detalhes de roteamento."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
msgid "You can set headers like this:"
msgstr "Você pode definir headers assim:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$response = $response->withHeader('Content-type', 'application/json');\n"
msgstr "$response = $response->withHeader('Content-type', 'application/json');\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
msgid "If there is a need to append a header value to the existing header:"
msgstr "Se for preciso acrescentar um valor a um header existente:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$response = $response->withAddedHeader('Set-Cookie', 'qwerty=219ffwef9w0f; Domain=somecompany.co.uk; Path=/; Expires=Wed, 30 Aug 2019 00:00:00 GMT');\n"
msgstr "$response = $response->withAddedHeader('Set-Cookie', 'qwerty=219ffwef9w0f; Domain=somecompany.co.uk; Path=/; Expires=Wed, 30 Aug 2019 00:00:00 GMT');\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
msgid "And, if needed, headers could be removed:"
msgstr "E, se necessário, os headers podem ser removidos:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$response = $response->withoutHeader('Set-Cookie');\n"
msgstr "$response = $response->withoutHeader('Set-Cookie');\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
msgid "Response body is an object implementing `Psr\\Http\\Message\\StreamInterface`."
msgstr "O corpo da resposta é um objeto que implementa `Psr\\Http\\Message\\StreamInterface`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
msgid "You can write to it via the interface itself:"
msgstr "Você pode escrever nele pela própria interface:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/response.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$body = $response->getBody();\n"
"$body->write('Hello');\n"
msgstr ""
"$body = $response->getBody();\n"
"$body->write('Hello');\n"

